n Stefanski; NYG hired John Harbaugh), which typically adds short-term uncertainty and is reflected in modest shares. No get_coaching_changes/get_management_changes/get_injury_report structured data existed for any team this run (all returned 'no data source available'), so all injury/coaching claims above are WebSearch-sourced and I've flagged single-source items as such rather than treating them as confirmed.",
